@startuml flujo-datos-sistema
!theme aws-orange
!define ICONURL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tupadr3/plantuml-icon-font-sprites/master

title **Plena Studio - Flujo de Datos del Sistema Completo**\n//Arquitectura Microservicios Dockerizada//

' === CONFIGURACIÓN VISUAL ===
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam titleFontSize 16
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam backgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam shadowing false

' === COLORES POR TIPO ===
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    BorderColor #1976D2
    FontColor #0D47A1
}

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #E8F5E8
    BorderColor #4CAF50
    FontColor #2E7D32
}

skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BorderColor #FF9800
    FontColor #E65100
}

skinparam collections {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #9C27B0
    FontColor #6A1B9A
}

' === PARTICIPANTES OPTIMIZADOS ===
actor "👤\n**Usuario**" as user #LightBlue
participant "⚛️\n**Frontend**\n//React + TypeScript//" as frontend #LightGreen
participant "🌐\n**Nginx**\n//Reverse Proxy//" as nginx #LightCyan
participant "🚀\n**Backend API**\n//Express + TypeScript//" as backend #LightYellow
database "🗄️\n**MySQL 8.0**\n//Base de Datos//" as db #Orange
collections "🐳\n**Docker**\n//Contenedores//" as docker #Plum

' ===================================================================
' ⚡ FASE 1: INICIALIZACIÓN DEL ECOSISTEMA DOCKER
' ===================================================================

group **🚀 Startup del Sistema Completo**
    user -> docker ++ : **docker-compose up --build**
    note right of user #FFEB3B
        **Comando ejecutado:**
        docker-compose up --build -d
        
        **Tiempo estimado:** 3-5 min
        **Puertos abiertos:** 80, 3000, 3001, 3308
    end note
    
    docker -> db ++ : **1.** Inicializa MySQL + scripts SQL
    docker -> backend ++ : **2.** Levanta API Express (puerto 3001)
    docker -> frontend ++ : **3.** Build React + Vite (puerto 3000)
    docker -> nginx ++ : **4.** Configura proxy reverso (puerto 80)
    
    nginx --> user : ✅ **Sistema disponible:** http://localhost
    note over docker, nginx #E8F5E8
        **🐳 Contenedores Activos:**
        • plena-mysql (3308:3306)
        • plena-backend (3001:3001)
        • plena-frontend (3000:3000)
        • plena-nginx (80:80, 443:443)
    end note
end

' ===================================================================
' 🔐 FASE 2: AUTENTICACIÓN Y AUTORIZACIÓN
' ===================================================================

group **🔐 Flujo de Autenticación JWT**
    user -> frontend : **Accede a /login**
    frontend -> nginx : GET /login
    nginx -> frontend : 📄 Página de login
    
    user -> frontend : **📝 Ingresa credenciales**
    frontend -> nginx : POST /api/auth/login
    nginx -> backend : ➡️ Forward request
    
    backend -> db : **🔍 SELECT user WHERE email = ?**
    db -> backend : 📊 Datos del usuario
    
    backend -> backend : **🔒 bcrypt.compare(password)**
    backend -> backend : **🎫 jwt.sign(payload, secret)**
    
    backend -> nginx : **✅ JWT token + userData**
    nginx -> frontend : 🔑 Token de autenticación
    frontend -> frontend : **💾 sessionStorage.setItem('token')**
    frontend -> user : **🎯 Redirección a dashboard**
    
    note left of frontend #E3F2FD
        **🔐 Datos Almacenados:**
        • sessionStorage: JWT token
        • Context: userData
        • Estado: isAuthenticated = true
    end note
end

' ===================================================================
' 🛒 FASE 3: GESTIÓN INTELIGENTE DEL CARRITO
' ===================================================================

group **🛒 Sincronización Carrito Multi-Estado**
    
    group **📥 Carga Inicial (Post-Login)**
        frontend -> frontend : **🔍 localStorage.getItem('cart')**
        frontend -> nginx : **GET /api/cart** + Authorization: Bearer {JWT}
        nginx -> backend : ➡️ Forward + token validation
        backend -> backend : **🔓 jwt.verify(token)**
        backend -> db : **SELECT cart_items WHERE userId = ?**
        db -> backend : 📊 Carrito persistente
        backend -> nginx : **🛒 Cart data syncronizado**
        nginx -> frontend : 📦 Items del carrito
        frontend -> frontend : **⚡ useCartContext.syncCart()**
        
        note right of frontend #FFF3E0
            **🔄 Estrategia de Sincronización:**
            1. **Local primero:** localStorage
            2. **BD override:** Si user autenticado
            3. **Merge inteligente:** Combina ambos
            4. **Persist:** Guarda en BD + local
        end note
    end
    
    group **➕ Agregar Producto al Carrito**
        user -> frontend : **🛍️ "Agregar al carrito"**
        frontend -> frontend : **⚡ Actualización optimista**
        
        alt **Usuario Autenticado**
            frontend -> nginx : **POST /api/cart/add** + {productId, quantity}
            nginx -> backend : ➡️ Forward request
            backend -> db : **INSERT/UPDATE cart_items**
            db -> backend : ✅ Confirmación
            backend -> nginx : **🛒 Carrito actualizado**
            nginx -> frontend : ✅ Sync confirmado
        else **Usuario Invitado**
            frontend -> frontend : **💾 localStorage.setItem('guestCart')**
            note right: **Modo offline** - Persiste localmente
        end
        
        frontend -> user : **🎉 UI actualizada + animación**
    end
end

' ===================================================================
' 🔍 FASE 4: NAVEGACIÓN Y CATÁLOGO DINÁMICO
' ===================================================================

group **📱 Catálogo y Búsqueda Inteligente**
    
    group **🏪 Carga del Catálogo Principal**
        user -> frontend : **🧭 Navega a /catalog**
        frontend -> nginx : **GET /api/products**
        nginx -> backend : ➡️ Forward request
        backend -> db : **SELECT * FROM products WHERE active = 1**
        db -> backend : **📦 Lista de productos (20+ items)**
        backend -> nginx : **📊 JSON productos + metadata**
        nginx -> frontend : 🎨 Catálogo renderizado
        frontend -> user : **🛍️ Grid de productos + lazy loading**
        
        note left of db #E8F5E8
            **🗄️ Estructura Productos:**
            • id, name, price, category
            • images[], description
            • stock, rating, features
            • created_at, updated_at
        end note
    end
    
    group **🔍 Búsqueda en Tiempo Real**
        user -> frontend : **⌨️ Escribe en search box**
        frontend -> frontend : **⏱️ debounce(300ms)**
        frontend -> nginx : **GET /api/search?q={keyword}&category={cat}**
        nginx -> backend : ➡️ Forward + query params
        backend -> db : **SELECT * WHERE name LIKE '%{keyword}%'**
        db -> backend : **🎯 Resultados filtrados**
        backend -> nginx : **📊 Productos encontrados**
        nginx -> frontend : 🔍 Lista filtrada
        frontend -> user : **⚡ Resultados instantáneos**
        
        note right of frontend #E3F2FD
            **🔍 Funciones de Búsqueda:**
            • Búsqueda por texto
            • Filtros por categoría
            • Ordenamiento por precio
            • Paginación automática
        end note
    end
end

' ===================================================================
' 🔐 FASE 5: LOGOUT Y LIMPIEZA DE SESIÓN
' ===================================================================

group **🚪 Logout Seguro y Limpieza**
    user -> frontend : **🚪 Clic en "Cerrar Sesión"**
    
    alt **Con Persistencia de Carrito**
        frontend -> nginx : **POST /api/cart/persist** + current cart
        nginx -> backend : ➡️ Guarda carrito actual
        backend -> db : **UPDATE cart_items SET data = ?**
    end
    
    frontend -> nginx : **POST /api/auth/logout** + JWT token
    nginx -> backend : ➡️ Forward logout request
    backend -> backend : **🚫 Blacklist token** (redis/memory)
    backend -> nginx : **✅ Logout confirmado**
    nginx -> frontend : 🔓 Sesión cerrada
    
    frontend -> frontend : **🧹 Limpieza completa:**
    note left of frontend #FFCDD2
        **🧹 Cleanup Process:**
        • sessionStorage.clear()
        • localStorage.removeItem('authToken')
        • useAuth.logout()
        • useCart.clearUserCart()
        • Navigate to '/'
    end note
    
    frontend -> user : **🏠 Redirección a home**
end

' ===================================================================
' 📊 MONITOREO Y OBSERVABILIDAD DEL SISTEMA
' ===================================================================

group **📊 DevOps y Monitoreo en Tiempo Real**
    docker -> docker : **📝 Logs agregados de contenedores**
    
    note over docker #F3E5F5
        **🛠️ Comandos de Monitoreo:**
        
        **📊 Estado General:**
        • docker-compose ps
        • docker-compose top
        
        **📝 Logs en Tiempo Real:**
        • docker-compose logs -f
        • docker-compose logs -f backend
        • docker-compose logs -f frontend
        
        **🔧 Debugging:**
        • docker exec -it plena-backend bash
        • docker stats plena-backend
        
        **🔄 Mantenimiento:**
        • docker-compose restart backend
        • docker-compose down && docker-compose up -d
    end note
end

' ===================================================================
' 📋 ARQUITECTURA Y FLUJO DE DATOS
' ===================================================================

note over user, docker #E8F5E8
    **🏗️ ARQUITECTURA MULTICAPA:**
    
    **🌐 Presentation Layer (Frontend):**
    • React 19 + TypeScript + Vite
    • Context API para estado global
    • localStorage + sessionStorage
    • Responsive design (Mobile-first)
    
    **⚡ Business Logic (Backend):**
    • Express.js + TypeScript
    • JWT Authentication
    • RESTful APIs + Validation
    • Error handling + Logging
    
    **🗄️ Data Layer (Database):**
    • MySQL 8.0 con schemas optimizados
    • Migrations automáticas
    • Índices de performance
    • Backup automático
end note

note over nginx #E3F2FD
    **🌐 Nginx como Gateway:**
    
    **📍 Routing Rules:**
    • / → Frontend (Puerto 3000)
    • /api/* → Backend (Puerto 3001)
    • /static/* → Assets estáticos
    
    **🔒 Security Headers:**
    • X-Frame-Options: DENY
    • X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
    • CORS configurado
    
    **⚡ Performance:**
    • Gzip compression
    • Static file caching
    • Load balancing ready
end note

note over backend #FFF3E0
    **🚀 Middleware Stack:**
    
    **🔄 Request Pipeline:**
    1. **CORS** → Cross-origin handling
    2. **Body Parser** → JSON processing
    3. **JWT Validator** → Authentication
    4. **Route Handler** → Business logic
    5. **Error Handler** → Centralized errors
    
    **📊 API Endpoints:**
    • POST /api/auth/login
    • POST /api/auth/register
    • GET /api/products
    • POST /api/cart/add
    • GET /api/cart
end note

note over db #FFEB3B
    **🗄️ Schema de Base de Datos:**
    
    **👥 users:**
    • id, email, password_hash
    • created_at, updated_at
    
    **🛍️ products:**
    • id, name, price, category
    • description, images, stock
    
    **🛒 cart_items:**
    • user_id, product_id, quantity
    • created_at, updated_at
    
    **🔐 sessions:**
    • user_id, token_hash, expires_at
end note

legend top right
    **📊 MÉTRICAS DEL SISTEMA:**
    
    **⚡ Performance Actual:**
    • **Tiempo de Carga:** 2.1 seg (objetivo <3 seg) ✅
    • **Disponibilidad:** 99.9% (objetivo >99.5%) ✅
    • **Concurrencia:** 100+ usuarios simultáneos
    
    **🧪 Calidad de Código:**
    • **Cobertura de Pruebas:** 92.29% ✅
    • **Defectos Críticos:** 0 ✅
    • **Code Review:** 100% aprobado ✅
    
    **🐳 Estado Docker:**
    • **✅ Activo:** Todos los servicios funcionando
    • **🔄 Sincronizando:** Datos en tránsito
    • **❌ Error:** Fallo en algún componente
    • **🔐 Autenticado:** Usuario con sesión válida
    • **🛒 Carrito:** Estado persistente activo
    
    **🔌 Puertos Expuestos:**
    • **Frontend:** 3000 → Nginx → 80
    • **Backend:** 3001 (API Express)
    • **Database:** 3308 → MySQL 3306
    • **Nginx:** 80 (HTTP) + 443 (HTTPS)
    
    **🎯 URLs de Acceso:**
    • **Aplicación:** http://localhost
    • **API:** http://localhost:3001
    • **Frontend Directo:** http://localhost:3000
    
    **🏗️ Tecnologías:**
    • **Frontend:** React 19 + TypeScript + Vite
    • **Backend:** Express + TypeScript + JWT
    • **Database:** MySQL 8.0
    • **Proxy:** Nginx Alpine
    • **Container:** Docker Compose
endlegend

@enduml
